                            <h1 class="first-head"> Welcome to Pulastya <span class="brdr"></span><span>A Better Tomorrow Together !</span></h1> 
                            <p>Registered under the Companies Act, 2013, the company is committed to building a transparent, ethical and sustainable direct-selling ecosystem where quality products and meaningful business opportunities come together. At Pulastya Globals India, we believe that a healthier lifestyle begins with informed choices and access to reliable products. Our focus is on offering carefully developed health and wellness solutions while continuously working towards improving product quality, customer experience and distributor support.</p>
                            <p>With a people-first approach, we aim to build long-term relationships with our customers and business associates through trust, transparency, integrity and responsible business practices.</p>
                            <p>Our vision is to grow as a respected name in the direct-selling industry by creating value for customers, empowering our business associates and contributing positively to the communities we serve.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="container ">
