                    <div class="sec-inf">
                        <h2 class="first-head">Our Vision<span class="brdr"></span></h2>
                        <p>Transparent business plant and world class products. Pulastya Globals Family is aiming to reach every house hold create entrepreneur propagating health and wellness rapidly.</p>
                    </div>    
                    <div class="sec-inf">
                        <h2 class="first-head">Our Mission<span class="brdr"></span></h2>
                        <p>We inspire for healthy living by promoting natural well-being and enable people to discover their business potential. Our Topmost goal is to engage people for spreading education of preventive healthcare and lifestyle thence to achieve their own corporal, mental and financial health.</p>
                        <p>We value high quality of research and develop products that are essential for day to day living. Our in-house team of research and development follows the ideology of developing the products close to biological rhythm and nature.</p>
